  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "4,500 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Black Lungs spell (Necromancy) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 3. You cause the target to succumb to an infection and corruption of the lungs: its speed is reduced by half, it loses any Dexterity bonus to Armor Class, and it takes a -2 penalty on attack rolls.",
