  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "11,250 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Blessing of the Snake Mother spell (Transmutation) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 5. The target assumes some of the qualities of the yuan-ti tainted one template, gaining the Alertness feat and other benefits as the text describes.",
