  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "750 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Bonerattle spell (Evocation) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 1. You create a deep resonating vibration that damages bone, dealing sonic damage to one creature with bones; it does not affect creatures without true bones.",
