  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "750 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Harmony spell (Enchantment) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 1. When you play your instrument, sing, recite, or speak words of encouragement, your inspire competence or similar bardic music grants a +4 bonus instead of the normal bonus, as the text describes.",
