  "name": "Wand of Protection from Possession (CL 1st)",
  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "750 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Protection from Possession spell (Abjuration) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 1. This spell wards a creature against mental control and possession attempts, blocking any attempt to possess the warded creature or exercise mental control over it.",
