  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "11,250 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Song of the Calling spell (Abjuration) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 5. You force a ghost to succumb to the Calling and depart immediately for the True Afterlife; each level in the eidolon class the target ghost has gives it a -1 penalty on its saving throw.",
  "source": "Dungeon Master's Guide — Wands (standard wand price table)",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.d20srd.org/srd/magicItems/wands.htm",
  "ruleset": "core"
