  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "750 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Spittle Spray spell (Transmutation) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 1. You can spit out to close range; if you have a poison bite attack, this spell lets you spit your poison out to that range with a ranged touch attack.",
