  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "21,000 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Summon Firearm spell (Conjuration) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 7. You call forth one small firearm directly to your hand; the spell magically links a firearm you possess to a pearl worth no less than 500 gp.",
