  "name": "Wand of Tale of Bravery (CL 1st)",
  "category": "wand",
  "cost": "750 gp",
  "summary": "Holds the Tale of Bravery spell (Enchantment) with 50 charges, cast at caster level 1. You infuse yourself with confidence and skill, allowing you to use your bardic abilities with extra potency, as the text describes.",
  "source": "Dungeon Master's Guide — Wands (standard wand price table)",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.d20srd.org/srd/magicItems/wands.htm",
