  "name": "Scroll of Mimicry",
  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "25 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Mimicry (Transmutation), scribed at caster level 1. You can perfectly mimic familiar sounds, voices, and accents for the duration.",
