  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "150 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Bottomless Hate (Enchantment), scribed at caster level 3. You fill yourself with a terrible hatred against your favored enemies, gaining a +1 morale bonus on attack and damage rolls against them for every three caster levels.",
