  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "1,650 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Contingent Spell Lock (Transmutation), scribed at caster level 11. You transfer some of your currently prepared spells or available spell slots to a hidden part of your soul, so that if you die and appear on the Ethereal Plane, you have those spells or slots available.",
