  "name": "Scroll of Create Ectoplasm",
  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "25 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Create Ectoplasm (Conjuration), scribed at caster level 1. You create raw ectoplasm — sticky or slippery, as you choose — from your hands, eyes, or mouth.",
