  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "150 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Delay Manifestation (Abjuration), scribed at caster level 3. You prevent the subject creature from manifesting as a ghost for the duration: if it dies, it appears on the Ethereal Plane as normal but cannot enter the Material Plane while the spell lasts.",
