  "cost": "3,825 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Investiture of the Hellfire Engine (Transmutation), scribed at caster level 17. The affected creature gains all the benefits of the iron body spell except that its flesh transforms into living cold iron, and it can breathe a 30-foot cone of hellfire that deals 8d10 points of damage. It also gains resistance to fire 20. The subject is fatigued for 1 minute after the spell ends, as with all investiture spells.",
  "source": "Dungeon Master's Guide — Scrolls (standard scroll price table)",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.d20srd.org/srd/magicItems/scrolls.htm",
  "ruleset": "core"
