  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "3,000 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Investiture of the Horned Devil (Transmutation), scribed at caster level 15. Whenever the subject successfully strikes another living creature with the first melee attack it makes in a round, the struck creature must succeed on a Will save or be stunned for 1 round. The subject also gains resistance to fire 10. The subject is fatigued for 1 minute after the spell ends, as with all investiture spells.",
