  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "700 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Summon Firearm (Conjuration), scribed at caster level 7. You call forth one small firearm directly to your hand; the spell magically links a firearm you possess to a pearl worth no less than 500 gp.",
