  "name": "Scroll of Tale of Bravery",
  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "25 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Tale of Bravery (Enchantment), scribed at caster level 1. You infuse yourself with confidence and skill, allowing you to use your bardic abilities with extra potency, as the text describes.",
