  "category": "scroll",
  "cost": "25 gp",
  "summary": "A scroll of Extend Shifting (Transmutation), scribed at caster level 1. Cast while shifting, this spell magically extends the duration of that use of your shifting ability by 4 rounds; when it ends, you become fatigued for 10 minutes.",
